{0 awskit-lwt}

Generic Lwt runtime adapter for Awskit.

The public entrypoint is {!module:Awskit_lwt}. This package provides the Lwt
runtime contract over a caller-supplied [Cohttp_lwt.S.Client]. It is intended
for applications or libraries that need to choose their own Lwt HTTP backend.

Use the [awskit-lwt-unix] package instead when a ready Unix-backed runtime is
enough.
